# x marks a task done with today's date and a second x removes it again.
file <<END
Launch:
	- Write announcement @owner(kim)
	- Update docs
END
keys j x
see ✔ Write announcement
keys j x x
see ▌   - Update docs
quit
saved <<END
Launch:
	- Write announcement @owner(kim) @done({today})
	- Update docs
END
